      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://hometownhistorymaps.com/pages/history-of-yeagertown-pennsylvania"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Collectors and hobbyists use the maps to recreate Yeagertown’s streetscape for model railroad projects.",
